WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.338 --> 00:00:15.049
The tools belong to the Cook Islanders.

00:00:16.599 --> 00:00:19.343
Tātatau was current in the islands

00:00:22.124 --> 00:00:25.404
it’s just that colonialism had wiped it out.

00:00:30.414 --> 00:00:33.675
There’s not anyone else here doing the traditional form.

00:00:52.369 --> 00:00:55.683
The revival here started out from tattoo machines.

00:00:58.559 --> 00:01:00.798
The machine is not connected to the old ways

00:01:01.332 --> 00:01:07.434
so I think that gap is vast for an outsider to stand up

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:09.131
in that gap and hold the tools up.

00:01:09.873 --> 00:01:11.433
It can be challenging.

00:01:22.921 --> 00:01:27.114
I have a lung condition, it’s something that I’m born with,

00:01:27.529 --> 00:01:29.194
it’s not something I contracted and

00:01:30.093 --> 00:01:32.266
it’s also something that you can’t catch.

00:01:32.987 --> 00:01:34.440
Cystic fibrosis is the name.

00:01:35.689 --> 00:01:37.450
For me it’s personally been a helping hand,

00:01:38.217 --> 00:01:39.726
it’s been something that’s...

00:01:40.475 --> 00:01:43.023
I felt like made me engage in life.

00:01:55.270 --> 00:01:56.818
What makes Moko a good student,

00:01:57.915 --> 00:01:59.019
he carries the tools well,

00:01:59.467 --> 00:02:01.321
he takes the responsibility really seriously.

00:02:03.082 --> 00:02:05.239
I think the importance of teaching and

00:02:05.735 --> 00:02:09.999
having an apprentice and what we do is something

00:02:10.311 --> 00:02:11.811
that has been done for a really long time.

00:02:12.936 --> 00:02:15.628
That act of now sharing that with Moko confirms that.

00:02:23.319 --> 00:02:27.405
The responsibility with the tools is an important one

00:02:27.405 --> 00:02:31.662
because the tools, the designs, they don't belong to me

00:02:31.662 --> 00:02:33.261
and it’s something that’s been passed down.

00:02:33.904 --> 00:02:37.700
So it’s my responsibility to ensure that they are in safe hands.

00:02:42.979 --> 00:02:46.928
It’s like being a caretaker, a caretaker of everything,

00:02:47.526 --> 00:02:51.249
it’s like using it with love and passion and respect.

